<div>
    Build flexible, powerful rules to determine which builds should be kept or deleted from history. Rules can evaluate
    factors such as build number, age, completion status, and more. You can manage these rules individually at the job
    level or enforce them globally across the entire organization.

    Visit
    <a href="https://github.com/jenkinsci/build-history-manager-plugin/wiki">wiki</a>
    to check all available features.
</div>
